sequenceDiagram
    participant Panel as ModelReadinessPanel.tsx
    participant Backend as EXPECTED LOCAL BACKEND CONTRACT
    participant Disk as Local model storage (backend-owned)

    Note over Backend: BACKEND TODO FOR CODEX below — none of this exists in this repo yet.
    Panel->>Backend: POST /api/model/prepare { model_id }
    Backend->>Disk: check if model_id already present on disk
    alt already downloaded
        Disk-->>Backend: present
        Backend-->>Panel: model_present_on_disk=true, state=checking_model → loading/ready<br/>(no new heavy download needed)
    else not present, another request already downloading it
        Backend-->>Panel: state=downloading, shared_download=true,<br/>model_download_in_progress=true, progress_percent shared with the owning download
        Note over Backend: deduplicate_model_downloads=true (policy) means one artifact,<br/>N callers observe the same operation/progress instead of starting N downloads
    else not present, no download in progress
        Backend->>Backend: evaluate admission (50/50/50 preflight) before starting
        alt admission passes
            Backend-->>Panel: state=downloading, shared_download=false
        else admission fails
            Backend-->>Panel: state=blocked, blocking_reasons=[insufficient_*]
        end
    end
    Note over Panel: Even when a model is already downloaded or a process is reusable,<br/>the runtime floors (30/25/30) must still be met before state=ready.
